  "summary": {
    "text": "DeepSeek-R1 is a reasoning language model built on DeepSeek-V3-Base, released on 20 January 2025 in the DeepSeek web chat (DeepThink), in the API as deepseek-reasoner and as open weights under the MIT License. DeepSeek trained it in two fine-tuning and two reinforcement learning stages to address the repetition, readability and language-mixing problems of DeepSeek-R1-Zero.",
    "sources": [
      {
