  "notes": "In the DeepSeek web chat it ran behind the DeepThink button; in the API as model deepseek-reasoner, which later served other models, so that alias is only a candidate. The 2025-01-20 change log entry says DeepSeek-V3 can be invoked with model deepseek-reasoner, an apparent slip (the same entry calls deepseek-reasoner the new model DeepSeek-R1). The six DeepSeek-R1-Distill models released the same day are built on Qwen2.5 and Llama 3 models and are not records."
